      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey prof, i'm stuck on the fourier transform part of my signal processing class. i get the math formula with the integrals and the complex exponentials, but i don't really get the actual intuition. like, how am i supposed to visualize how a single signal is broken down into different frequencies? it feels like there's just stuff happening that i can't see.",
